        "Claudio Pellegrini",
        "Evgeny Saldin",
        "Kwang-Je Kim"
      ],
      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "SASE X-ray free-electron lasers created an extraordinary new source for resolving ultrafast and atomic-scale phenomena.",
        "attribution": "Pellegrini, Saldin, and Kim made foundational conceptual and technical contributions spanning the SASE principle and its accelerator realization.",
        "maturity": "Multiple facilities have operated successfully for years and the method has reshaped X-ray photon science.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The detailed intellectual lineage includes many accelerator and FEL contributors."
        ]
      }
    },
