        "Charles L. Bennett",
        "Lyman A. Page",
        "David N. Spergel"
      ],
      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "WMAP made cosmology quantitatively precise through a remarkably successful all-sky measurement of the microwave background.",
        "attribution": "Bennett and Page represent decisive experimental leadership; Spergel represents the central cosmological interpretation of the data.",
        "maturity": "Its results were independently refined by later CMB experiments and remain foundational to precision cosmology.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "It may be difficult to separate WMAP's achievement cleanly from the wider CMB experimental program."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
