        "attribution": "Heijne, Jarron, and Parker represent seminal detector concepts and their practical development into high-performance instruments.",
        "maturity": "The technologies are thoroughly validated in major experiments and have generated wide scientific and societal impact.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The incremental path from semiconductor technology to modern detector systems has many essential contributors."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "rank": 8,
