        "attribution": "Charbonneau and Henry established early transit detection, while Borucki led Kepler's decisive statistical survey.",
        "maturity": "Thousands of follow-up detections and atmospheric studies have confirmed the method's enduring scientific importance.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Exoplanet discovery has several comparably compelling routes and a large number of indispensable contributors."
